{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年に引き続き\n乃木どこで浴衣着た。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/13/0148293/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回は白地に金魚柄。\n今回は湖にスワン。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当は違う柄に決めてたんだけど\nみんなにまりかっぽいって言われて\nこの柄に決めました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/13/0148293/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふぁー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうですか。\nまりかっぽいですか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/13/0148293/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帯等の小物は自分で選んだよー\n帯の刺繍かわいい。赤色かわいい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また着れる機会があったら\n生き物柄かな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/13/0148293/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は今まで夏に選抜入りしたので\nこれまでに2回\n浴衣着ることが出来ました。\n次も夏に入ったらきっと浴衣を\nみなさんにお見せできる、\nと思います。いえい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というか、\n浴衣欲しい！\nマイ浴衣！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！えっと！\n今回の乃木どこのこと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"怖い話大っ嫌いなので\nスルーします！えっと、\nスルーしますごめんなさい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"逃"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}